OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency services at scene of oil
OL,4,Atank fire near Glenavon FC
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are attending the
OL,7,Fscene of an oil tank on fire in a
OL,8,Fresidential area of County Armagh,
OL,9,Fclose to Glenavon Football Club.
OL,11,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService (NIFRS) was alerted to the
OL,13,Fincident at Mourneview Avenue in Lurgan
OL,14,Fat 11:43 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FThree fire service appliances are
OL,17,Fcurrently in attendance at the scene.
OL,19,FPolice are asking road users and
OL,20,Fmembers of the public to avoid the
OL,21,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
